    "For npm, once Node.js is installed (apk add npm).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于 npm，需先安装 Node.js（apk add npm）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用於 npm，需先安裝 Node.js（apk add npm）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For pip, once Python is installed (apk add py3-pip).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于 pip，需先安装 Python（apk add py3-pip）。"
          }
        },
