    "Linux system did not start: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Linux 系统未能启动：%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Linux 系統未能啟動：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mirrors": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "软件源镜像"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "軟體源鏡像"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temporary files are the pages and screenshots the model saved while browsing. Screenshots in earlier chats will no longer open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "临时文件是模型浏览网页时存下的页面文本和截图。清除后，以前对话里的这些截图将无法再打开。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暫存檔案是模型瀏覽網頁時存下的頁面文字和截圖。清除後，先前對話裡的這些截圖將無法再開啟。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test speed and use the fastest": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "测速并使用最快的"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "測速並使用最快的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thinking: for new chats, with any model. Each chat can change it from its model menu.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "思考：用于所有模型的新对话。每个对话可在模型菜单里单独更改。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "思考：用於所有模型的新對話。每個對話可在模型選單裡單獨更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Times every source from this device and switches to the fastest. A newly installed Linux system does this on its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从本机测试每个源的响应速度，并切换到最快的。新安装的 Linux 系统会自动这样做。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "從本機測試每個來源的回應速度，並切換到最快的。新安裝的 Linux 系統會自動這樣做。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where apk installs Linux packages from.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "apk 安装 Linux 软件包的下载源。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "apk 安裝 Linux 套件的下載來源。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
