    "Tokens. Leave empty to use what the endpoint reports (%llu). Near the limit, old tool output is cleared and the chat asks before summarising.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "单位是 token。留空则使用接入点报告的值（%llu）。接近上限时会先清掉旧的工具输出，再询问是否总结。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "單位是 token。留空則使用端點報告的值（%llu）。接近上限時會先清掉舊的工具輸出，再詢問是否總結。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tokens. The endpoint does not report this model's window; without one, a chat only learns it is too long when the endpoint refuses.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "单位是 token。接入点没有报告这个模型的窗口；不填的话，对话只有在接入点拒绝时才知道太长了。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
